message:
Authentication required for https://shadcnblocks.com pro blocks.

To access this registry:
1. Generate an API key at https://shadcnblocks.com/dashboard/api
2. Add it to your components.json:

{
  "registries": {
    "@shadcnblocks": {
      "url": "https://www.shadcnblocks.com/r/{name}",
      "headers": {
        "Authorization": "Bearer ${YOUR_API_KEY}"
      }
    }
  }
}
